    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "2852a14e61a245b1273f": "I seek training.",
        "8260d95fbf794b289c52": "Greetings young rogue. What do you seek?",
        "a2d5d82ed60a9be9f2eb": "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?",
        "a4809317959ab68bb6e6": "We are but darkness and shadows. Eternal. Invisible.",
        "a5a358faab931c26ccde": "Messengers from Ravenholdt delivered this letter to me this morning. It is addressed to you, $n.",
        "fb1cb2aee8ed40e34195": "I don't train your kind $c."
      },
      "name": "Erion Shadewhisper",
      "subName": "Rogue Trainer",
